{"sounds":{"intro":"Kyrgyz uses Cyrillic with three extra letters. There are no genders and no articles. The stress is usually on the last syllable. Learn the special letters first.","rows":[["ө","say \"oh\" with rounded lips, like German \"ö\"","өрдөк (ur-DUK)"],["ү","say \"ee\" with rounded lips, like German \"ü\"","үй (ewy)"],["ң","like \"ng\" in \"sing\"","миң (ming)"],["ы","a short, flat \"uh\", like the \"a\" in \"about\"","алты (al-TUH)"],["к / г","at the back of the mouth these are made further back, in back-vowel words","кыз (kuhz)"],["ж","like \"j\" in \"jam\"","жок (zhok)"]],"notes":["Vowel harmony: back vowels (а, о, у, ы) and front vowels (э, и, ө, ү) are not mixed in one word. Suffixes follow the same rule."]},"numbers":[{"id":"0-to-10","title":"0 to 10","items":[["zero","нөл","nul"],["one","бир","beer"],["two","эки","eh-KEE"],["three","үч","ewch"],["four","төрт","turt"],["five","беш","besh"],["six","алты","al-TUH"],["seven","жети","zheh-TEE"],["eight","сегиз","seh-GEEZ"],["nine","тогуз","toh-GOOZ"],["ten","он","on"]]},{"id":"11-to-20","title":"11 to 20","items":[["eleven","он бир","on BEER"],["twelve","он эки","on eh-KEE"],["thirteen","он үч","on EWCH"],["fourteen","он төрт","on TURT"],["fifteen","он беш","on BESH"],["sixteen","он алты","on al-TUH"],["seventeen","он жети","on zheh-TEE"],["eighteen","он сегиз","on seh-GEEZ"],["nineteen","он тогуз","on toh-GOOZ"],["twenty","жыйырма","zhuh-uhr-MAH"]]},{"id":"tens-and-big-numbers","title":"Tens and big numbers","items":[["twenty-one","жыйырма бир","zhuh-uhr-MAH BEER"],["thirty","отуз","oh-TOOZ"],["forty","кырк","kuhrk"],["fifty","элүү","eh-LEW"],["sixty","алтымыш","al-tuh-MUHSH"],["seventy","жетимиш","zheh-tee-MEESH"],["eighty","сексен","sek-SEN"],["ninety","токсон","tok-SON"],["one hundred","жүз","zewz"],["two hundred","эки жүз","eh-KEE ZEWZ"],["one thousand","миң","ming"],["two thousand","эки миң","eh-KEE MING"],["ten thousand","он миң","on MING"],["one hundred thousand","жүз миң","zewz MING"],["one mil